ts parent, so every child precedes its parent in reverse. Anyone rewriting one of these recursively should generate a file with a few thousand nested blocks first."},"chain":"3627b65fe51bcd40a93ae90139a437073e4ff2d239804f0a935723733e06e2a7","code_revision":"0c33ef54cc2c8f531c987780b16eb55d08445031","created":1790247024,"kind":"invariant","lifecycle":"active","schema":1}
